    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/10d61f4f3b68443d3bce196e54d08802.webp?t=1707566648\" width=610 height=62 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/4b7d510a1d0457d89bb0b77baa94b18c.avif?t=1707566648\" width=618 height=348 /></span><br><br>Factories of Golden Waters is a <strong>real time strategy and city building </strong>game that challenges you to run a profitable shipping and manufacturing industry. It is about <strong>business automation</strong> where you will build docks and transport materials to factories using the most efficient methods.<br><br>The seemingly dry, barren lands where you operate have a hidden treasure: <strong>the shimmering water</strong>. This rare compound can be extracted by specially engineered factories and turned into <strong>gold</strong> with simple materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.poster.avif?t=1707566648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.webm?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.mp4?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Optimize your delivery of resources by chaining multiple factories together.<br></li><li> Adjust your strategy by removing and replacing docks and waterways as needed.<br></li><li> Control the time flow to speed up or slow down the game.<br></li><li> Buy and place docks at the best locations for efficiency.<br></li><li> Draw waterways to connect factories and docks.<br></li><li> Guide the ships to and from the factories using different routes.<br></li><li> Buy resources for your factories to produce gold.<br></li><li> Review your performance in different aspects at the end of each session.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.poster.avif?t=1707566648\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.webm?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.mp4?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/59be70351e0baa26818f2ed715827be5.webp?t=1707566648\" width=610 height=62 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/10d61f4f3b68443d3bce196e54d08802.webp?t=1707566648\" width=610 height=62 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/4b7d510a1d0457d89bb0b77baa94b18c.avif?t=1707566648\" width=618 height=348 /></span><br><br>Factories of Golden Waters is a <strong>real time strategy and city building </strong>game that challenges you to run a profitable shipping and manufacturing industry. It is about <strong>business automation</strong> where you will build docks and transport materials to factories using the most efficient methods.<br><br>The seemingly dry, barren lands where you operate have a hidden treasure: <strong>the shimmering water</strong>. This rare compound can be extracted by specially engineered factories and turned into <strong>gold</strong> with simple materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.poster.avif?t=1707566648\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.webm?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/6dcca295e33b05b615aa1873d8a0eb6d.mp4?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Optimize your delivery of resources by chaining multiple factories together.<br></li><li> Adjust your strategy by removing and replacing docks and waterways as needed.<br></li><li> Control the time flow to speed up or slow down the game.<br></li><li> Buy and place docks at the best locations for efficiency.<br></li><li> Draw waterways to connect factories and docks.<br></li><li> Guide the ships to and from the factories using different routes.<br></li><li> Buy resources for your factories to produce gold.<br></li><li> Review your performance in different aspects at the end of each session.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.poster.avif?t=1707566648\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.webm?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/b8d8cdeddff7cdea627e755b426967e7.mp4?t=1707566648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660440/extras/59be70351e0baa26818f2ed715827be5.webp?t=1707566648\" width=610 height=62 /></span>",
